{
  "_readme": [
    "Operational data for Tehran Metro, used offline by the app. Edit freely; no code changes needed.",
    "Every value marked \"verified\": false is a PLACEHOLDER and must be replaced with official data, then set \"verified\": true.",
    "While a value is unverified the app still uses it but labels it as unverified on screen.",
    "Directions: one entry per line and travel direction. \"toward\" is the station id (from metro_network.json) of the terminal the train is heading to, as shown on platform signs.",
    "lastTrain: departure time of the LAST train from the OPPOSITE terminal (where that direction starts), in Tehran local time, \"HH:mm\". Times after midnight may be written as 24:10, 24:30 …",
    "The app adds the estimated running time from that terminal to each boarding station.",
    "Day types: weekday = Saturday–Thursday, friday = Fridays, holiday = official holidays listed under holidays.dates. If holiday is missing the friday time is used.",
    "holidays.dates: Gregorian dates (YYYY-MM-DD, Tehran calendar day) of official public holidays.",
    "serviceDayStartsAt: times before this belong to the previous day’s service (so 00:30 is still ‘tonight’).",
    "stationEntryMinutes: time allowed to get from the station entrance to the platform at the origin.",
    "lastTrainWarningMinutes: show the ‘leave soon’ warning when the latest departure is within this many minutes.",
    "womenCars: carsPerTrain is the train length; womenOnlyCars lists women-only car numbers counted from the FRONT of the train (1 = first car in the direction of travel)."
  ],
